      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Standard Lite doesn't support transparency, because it's intended for quest/mobile avatars. If you're on PC, you should just use regular Standard. For quest worlds, you *can* use custom shaders, so Standard will also work, but there are other options too.",
