  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Whenever I set up the albedo with a defined alpha channel in the shader, does not actually makes it transparent or translucent. Instead, gets replaced with either infinite padding (Transparent) or remains unchanged (Translucent) if the image is set to \"Alpha is Transparency\" in the image options. It acts just like an opaque shader.\n\nThis is a demonstration of the alpha channel transparency issue: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xad_QD6_bHXvPhaDnhBxPCnZ8RSBTauL/view?usp=sharing",
